                       --lease 3600 --echo-option82 [--option82-override
                       circuit:WRONGVLAN,remote:WRONGREMOTE]

  Method: every leg sends 3 crafted DHCPDISCOVERs from eth3 and reads option 82 out of
  the frames three ways -- the eth4 capture (how many the DUT relayed), the scapy
  server's per-frame record on eth4 (what option 82 the DUT inserted, decoded sub-option
  by sub-option) and the client's own received OFFER on eth3 (what came back). Every
  positive leg is paired with a leg in the same configuration that must not produce it.
  Nothing rests on `show ip dhcp-relay`; the show output is corroboration read after the
  frames. The server is run with --echo-option82 throughout, so each reply arriving at
  the relay really does carry option 82 -- which is what makes the strip test (STEP 6)
  a measurement rather than an absence.

