  The guide, pp21-22: the policy "sets the action that the DHCP relay should take when a
  received DHCP client request contains Option 82 information". Each leg sends the SAME
  crafted DISCOVER carrying option 82 (circuit-id "CKCKT99", remote-id "CKREM99"); only
  the policy differs. `agent-option checking` was disabled for these legs so the response
